      "type": "string",
      "extract_value": "This section outlines the hypotheses for a study validating the Body Appreciation Scale-2 (BAS-2). The hypotheses cover the psychometric properties of the BAS-2, including its unidimensionality, internal consistency, test-retest reliability, construct validity (relationships with body-related variables and psychological well-being), criterion-related validity (associations with eating behavior), and incremental validity for both women and men. The study aims to solidify the BAS-2's need within body image research.",
